{"route":"/docs/5.3/forms/form-control/","version":"5.3","renderedVersion":"5.3","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Form controls","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Give textual form controls like <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>s and <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>s an upgrade with custom styles, sizing, focus states, and more."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Form controls are styled with a mix of Sass and CSS variables, allowing them to adapt to color modes and support any customization method."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"a9afa7986d4fabebe049","height":174,"anchors":["exampleFormControlInput1","exampleFormControlTextarea1"]},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"exampleFormControlInput1\" class=\"form-label\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"exampleFormControlInput1\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"exampleFormControlTextarea1\" class=\"form-label\">Example textarea</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"exampleFormControlTextarea1\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"sizing","type":"heading","en":"Sizing","level":2},{"id":"sizing--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Set heights using classes like <code>.form-control-lg</code> and <code>.form-control-sm</code>."},{"id":"sizing--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c76699ee48ec88e47901","height":201},{"id":"sizing--code-1","type":"code","value":"<input class=\"form-control form-control-lg\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\".form-control-lg\" aria-label=\".form-control-lg example\">\n<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Default input\" aria-label=\"default input example\">\n<input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\".form-control-sm\" aria-label=\".form-control-sm example\">","language":"html"},{"id":"form-text","type":"heading","en":"Form text","level":2},{"id":"form-text--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Block-level or inline-level form text can be created using <code>.form-text</code>."},{"id":"form-text--note-1","type":"note","tone":"warning","body":[{"id":"form-text--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"Form text should be explicitly associated with the form control it relates to using the <code>aria-describedby</code> attribute. This will ensure that assistive technologies—such as screen readers—will announce this form text when the user focuses or enters the control."}]},{"id":"form-text--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Form text below inputs can be styled with <code>.form-text</code>. If a block-level element will be used, a top margin is added for easy spacing from the inputs above."},{"id":"form-text--example-1","type":"demo","key":"214243839becc4f6c8b7","height":201,"anchors":["inputPassword5","passwordHelpBlock"]},{"id":"form-text--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"inputPassword5\" class=\"form-label\">Password</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"inputPassword5\" class=\"form-control\" aria-describedby=\"passwordHelpBlock\">\n<div id=\"passwordHelpBlock\" class=\"form-text\">\n  Your password must be 8-20 characters long, contain letters and numbers, and must not contain spaces, special characters, or emoji.\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"form-text--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Inline text can use any typical inline HTML element (be it a <code>&lt;span&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;small&gt;</code>, or something else) with nothing more than the <code>.form-text</code> class."},{"id":"form-text--example-2","type":"demo","key":"4ff8f31dcef39e4af7ee","height":147,"anchors":["inputPassword6","passwordHelpInline"]},{"id":"form-text--code-2","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"row g-3 align-items-center\">\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword6\" class=\"col-form-label\">Password</label>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <input type=\"password\" id=\"inputPassword6\" class=\"form-control\" aria-describedby=\"passwordHelpInline\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <span id=\"passwordHelpInline\" class=\"form-text\">\n      Must be 8-20 characters long.\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"disabled","type":"heading","en":"Disabled","level":2},{"id":"disabled--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>disabled</code> boolean attribute on an input to give it a grayed out appearance, remove pointer events, and prevent focusing."},{"id":"disabled--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c44b03e20539769bf08a","height":174},{"id":"disabled--code-1","type":"code","value":"<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Disabled input\" aria-label=\"Disabled input example\" disabled>\n<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" value=\"Disabled readonly input\" aria-label=\"Disabled input example\" disabled readonly>","language":"html"},{"id":"readonly","type":"heading","en":"Readonly","level":2},{"id":"readonly--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add the <code>readonly</code> boolean attribute on an input to prevent modification of the input’s value. <code>readonly</code> inputs can still be focused and selected, while <code>disabled</code> inputs cannot."},{"id":"readonly--example-1","type":"demo","key":"d37f37303648195c10ae","height":147},{"id":"readonly--code-1","type":"code","value":"<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" value=\"Readonly input here...\" aria-label=\"readonly input example\" readonly>","language":"html"},{"id":"readonly-plain-text","type":"heading","en":"Readonly plain text","level":2},{"id":"readonly-plain-text--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you want to have <code>&lt;input readonly&gt;</code> elements in your form styled as plain text, replace <code>.form-control</code> with <code>.form-control-plaintext</code> to remove the default form field styling and preserve the correct <code>margin</code> and <code>padding</code>."},{"id":"readonly-plain-text--example-1","type":"demo","key":"8cb63775fbcea05e0907","height":174,"anchors":["staticEmail","inputPassword"]},{"id":"readonly-plain-text--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mb-3 row\">\n  <label for=\"staticEmail\" class=\"col-sm-2 col-form-label\">Email</label>\n  <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n    <input type=\"text\" readonly class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"staticEmail\" value=\"email@example.com\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3 row\">\n  <label for=\"inputPassword\" class=\"col-sm-2 col-form-label\">Password</label>\n  <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword\">\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"readonly-plain-text--example-2","type":"demo","key":"cc87ca9630120ed1e4d0","height":300,"anchors":["staticEmail2","inputPassword2"]},{"id":"readonly-plain-text--code-2","type":"code","value":"<form class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"staticEmail2\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Email</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" readonly class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"staticEmail2\" value=\"email@example.com\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword2\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Password</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword2\" placeholder=\"Password\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary mb-3\">Confirm identity</button>\n  </div>\n</form>","language":"html"},{"id":"file-input","type":"heading","en":"File input","level":2},{"id":"file-input--example-1","type":"demo","key":"750203733fa966837a48","height":300,"anchors":["formFile","formFileMultiple","formFileDisabled","formFileSm","formFileLg"]},{"id":"file-input--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFile\" class=\"form-label\">Default file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFile\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileMultiple\" class=\"form-label\">Multiple files input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFileMultiple\" multiple>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileDisabled\" class=\"form-label\">Disabled file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFileDisabled\" disabled>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileSm\" class=\"form-label\">Small file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" id=\"formFileSm\" type=\"file\">\n</div>\n<div>\n  <label for=\"formFileLg\" class=\"form-label\">Large file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control form-control-lg\" id=\"formFileLg\" type=\"file\">\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"color","type":"heading","en":"Color","level":2},{"id":"color--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Set the <code>type=&quot;color&quot;</code> and add <code>.form-control-color</code> to the <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>. We use the modifier class to set fixed <code>height</code>s and override some inconsistencies between browsers."},{"id":"color--example-1","type":"demo","key":"209a44bf2493c1b6b358","height":174,"anchors":["exampleColorInput"]},{"id":"color--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"exampleColorInput\" class=\"form-label\">Color picker</label>\n<input type=\"color\" class=\"form-control form-control-color\" id=\"exampleColorInput\" value=\"#563d7c\" title=\"Choose your color\">","language":"html"},{"id":"datalists","type":"heading","en":"Datalists","level":2},{"id":"datalists--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Datalists allow you to create a group of <code>&lt;option&gt;</code>s that can be accessed (and autocompleted) from within an <code>&lt;input&gt;</code>. These are similar to <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> elements, but come with more menu styling limitations and differences. While most browsers and operating systems include some support for <code>&lt;datalist&gt;</code> elements, their styling is inconsistent at best."},{"id":"datalists--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Learn more about <a href=\"https://caniuse.com/datalist\">support for datalist elements</a>."},{"id":"datalists--example-1","type":"demo","key":"c1e20cab2f13a66918a1","height":201,"anchors":["exampleDataList","datalistOptions"]},{"id":"datalists--code-1","type":"code","value":"<label for=\"exampleDataList\" class=\"form-label\">Datalist example</label>\n<input class=\"form-control\" list=\"datalistOptions\" id=\"exampleDataList\" placeholder=\"Type to search...\">\n<datalist id=\"datalistOptions\">\n  <option value=\"San Francisco\">\n  <option value=\"New York\">\n  <option value=\"Seattle\">\n  <option value=\"Los Angeles\">\n  <option value=\"Chicago\">\n</datalist>","language":"html"},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-variables","type":"heading","en":"Sass variables","level":3},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>$input-*</code> are shared across most of our form controls (and not buttons)."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"$input-padding-y:                       $input-btn-padding-y;\n$input-padding-x:                       $input-btn-padding-x;\n$input-font-family:                     $input-btn-font-family;\n$input-font-size:                       $input-btn-font-size;\n$input-font-weight:                     $font-weight-base;\n$input-line-height:                     $input-btn-line-height;\n\n$input-padding-y-sm:                    $input-btn-padding-y-sm;\n$input-padding-x-sm:                    $input-btn-padding-x-sm;\n$input-font-size-sm:                    $input-btn-font-size-sm;\n\n$input-padding-y-lg:                    $input-btn-padding-y-lg;\n$input-padding-x-lg:                    $input-btn-padding-x-lg;\n$input-font-size-lg:                    $input-btn-font-size-lg;\n\n$input-bg:                              var(--#{$prefix}body-bg);\n$input-disabled-color:                  null;\n$input-disabled-bg:                     var(--#{$prefix}secondary-bg);\n$input-disabled-border-color:           null;\n\n$input-color:                           var(--#{$prefix}body-color);\n$input-border-color:                    var(--#{$prefix}border-color);\n$input-border-width:                    $input-btn-border-width;\n$input-box-shadow:                      var(--#{$prefix}box-shadow-inset);\n\n$input-border-radius:                   var(--#{$prefix}border-radius);\n$input-border-radius-sm:                var(--#{$prefix}border-radius-sm);\n$input-border-radius-lg:                var(--#{$prefix}border-radius-lg);\n\n$input-focus-bg:                        $input-bg;\n$input-focus-border-color:              tint-color($component-active-bg, 50%);\n$input-focus-color:                     $input-color;\n$input-focus-width:                     $input-btn-focus-width;\n$input-focus-box-shadow:                $input-btn-focus-box-shadow;\n\n$input-placeholder-color:               var(--#{$prefix}secondary-color);\n$input-plaintext-color:                 var(--#{$prefix}body-color);\n\n$input-height-border:                   calc(#{$input-border-width} * 2); // stylelint-disable-line function-disallowed-list\n\n$input-height-inner:                    add($input-line-height * 1em, $input-padding-y * 2);\n$input-height-inner-half:               add($input-line-height * .5em, $input-padding-y);\n$input-height-inner-quarter:            add($input-line-height * .25em, $input-padding-y * .5);\n\n$input-height:                          add($input-line-height * 1em, add($input-padding-y * 2, $input-height-border, false));\n$input-height-sm:                       add($input-line-height * 1em, add($input-padding-y-sm * 2, $input-height-border, false));\n$input-height-lg:                       add($input-line-height * 1em, add($input-padding-y-lg * 2, $input-height-border, false));\n\n$input-transition:                      border-color .15s ease-in-out, box-shadow .15s ease-in-out;\n\n$form-color-width:                      3rem;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>$form-label-*</code> and <code>$form-text-*</code> are for our <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>s and <code>.form-text</code> component."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-2","type":"code","value":"$form-label-margin-bottom:              .5rem;\n$form-label-font-size:                  null;\n$form-label-font-style:                 null;\n$form-label-font-weight:                null;\n$form-label-color:                      null;","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--code-3","type":"code","value":"$form-text-margin-top:                  .25rem;\n$form-text-font-size:                   $small-font-size;\n$form-text-font-style:                  null;\n$form-text-font-weight:                 null;\n$form-text-color:                       var(--#{$prefix}secondary-color);","language":"scss"},{"id":"sass-variables--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>$form-file-*</code> are for file input."},{"id":"sass-variables--code-4","type":"code","value":"$form-file-button-color:          $input-color;\n$form-file-button-bg:             var(--#{$prefix}tertiary-bg);\n$form-file-button-hover-bg:       var(--#{$prefix}secondary-bg);","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"a9afa7986d4fabebe049","html":" <div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"exampleFormControlInput1\" class=\"form-label\">Email address</label>\n  <input type=\"email\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"exampleFormControlInput1\" placeholder=\"name@example.com\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"exampleFormControlTextarea1\" class=\"form-label\">Example textarea</label>\n  <textarea class=\"form-control\" id=\"exampleFormControlTextarea1\" rows=\"3\"></textarea>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c76699ee48ec88e47901","html":" <input class=\"form-control form-control-lg\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\".form-control-lg\" aria-label=\".form-control-lg example\">\n<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Default input\" aria-label=\"default input example\">\n<input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\".form-control-sm\" aria-label=\".form-control-sm example\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"214243839becc4f6c8b7","html":" <label for=\"inputPassword5\" class=\"form-label\">Password</label>\n<input type=\"password\" id=\"inputPassword5\" class=\"form-control\" aria-describedby=\"passwordHelpBlock\">\n<div id=\"passwordHelpBlock\" class=\"form-text\">\n  Your password must be 8-20 characters long, contain letters and numbers, and must not contain spaces, special characters, or emoji.\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"4ff8f31dcef39e4af7ee","html":" <div class=\"row g-3 align-items-center\">\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword6\" class=\"col-form-label\">Password</label>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <input type=\"password\" id=\"inputPassword6\" class=\"form-control\" aria-describedby=\"passwordHelpInline\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <span id=\"passwordHelpInline\" class=\"form-text\">\n      Must be 8-20 characters long.\n    </span>\n  </div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c44b03e20539769bf08a","html":" <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Disabled input\" aria-label=\"Disabled input example\" disabled=\"\">\n<input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" value=\"Disabled readonly input\" aria-label=\"Disabled input example\" disabled=\"\" readonly=\"\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"d37f37303648195c10ae","html":" <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"text\" value=\"Readonly input here...\" aria-label=\"readonly input example\" readonly=\"\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"8cb63775fbcea05e0907","html":" <div class=\"mb-3 row\">\n  <label for=\"staticEmail\" class=\"col-sm-2 col-form-label\">Email</label>\n  <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n    <input type=\"text\" readonly=\"\" class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"staticEmail\" value=\"email@example.com\">\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3 row\">\n  <label for=\"inputPassword\" class=\"col-sm-2 col-form-label\">Password</label>\n  <div class=\"col-sm-10\">\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword\">\n  </div>\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"cc87ca9630120ed1e4d0","html":" <form class=\"row g-3\">\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"staticEmail2\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Email</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" readonly=\"\" class=\"form-control-plaintext\" id=\"staticEmail2\" value=\"email@example.com\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <label for=\"inputPassword2\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Password</label>\n    <input type=\"password\" class=\"form-control\" id=\"inputPassword2\" placeholder=\"Password\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-auto\">\n    <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary mb-3\">Confirm identity</button>\n  </div>\n</form> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"750203733fa966837a48","html":" <div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFile\" class=\"form-label\">Default file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFile\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileMultiple\" class=\"form-label\">Multiple files input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFileMultiple\" multiple=\"\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileDisabled\" class=\"form-label\">Disabled file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control\" type=\"file\" id=\"formFileDisabled\" disabled=\"\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"mb-3\">\n  <label for=\"formFileSm\" class=\"form-label\">Small file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" id=\"formFileSm\" type=\"file\">\n</div>\n<div>\n  <label for=\"formFileLg\" class=\"form-label\">Large file input example</label>\n  <input class=\"form-control form-control-lg\" id=\"formFileLg\" type=\"file\">\n</div> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"209a44bf2493c1b6b358","html":" <label for=\"exampleColorInput\" class=\"form-label\">Color picker</label>\n<input type=\"color\" class=\"form-control form-control-color\" id=\"exampleColorInput\" value=\"#563d7c\" title=\"Choose your color\"> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""},{"key":"c1e20cab2f13a66918a1","html":" <label for=\"exampleDataList\" class=\"form-label\">Datalist example</label>\n<input class=\"form-control\" list=\"datalistOptions\" id=\"exampleDataList\" placeholder=\"Type to search...\">\n<datalist id=\"datalistOptions\">\n  <option value=\"San Francisco\">\n  </option><option value=\"New York\">\n  </option><option value=\"Seattle\">\n  </option><option value=\"Los Angeles\">\n  </option><option value=\"Chicago\">\n</option></datalist> ","attrs":{"class":"bd-example m-0 border-0"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/introduction"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/download"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/contents"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/getting-started/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getb